          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Free career guidance online can be genuinely useful for building a shortlist, but many free tests and sessions exist to collect your phone number, so the safe approach is to check who runs the service, share the least personal data you can and test every result against real notices."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Check who runs them, what they do with your data and whether the result comes with a sales call."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "What to protect: Your phone number, marks, family income and address."
          }
        ]
      },
